cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tcslog: the TCS Onboard Log"
abstract: >-
  tcslog is a small, segmented telemetry log library for storage-bounded
  systems such as spacecraft. A log is split into segment files that can
  be sent to the ground one at a time; a record may continue across
  segments; and the reader recovers when segments are lost or damaged,
  saying what it lost. Writing and reading allocate nothing, and Rust,
  C/C++ and Python write one format, each reading what the others wrote.
authors:
  - name: "TCSpecial Team"
version: 0.6.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/vomlehn/tcslog"
keywords:
  - flight software
  - telemetry
  - logging
  - error recovery
  - spacecraft
  - Rust
